  background: ["19 years old; second-year physics major at a highly selective university","Takes a required applied-maths course (differential equations) alongside heavy lab and problem-set loads","His class mixes undergraduates and PhD students from many departments, some of them rusty after years away from maths","Laptop and fast campus internet; time is his scarce resource, not access","Sceptical of automated grading until he trusts it"],
