  hopes: ["Go to graduate school in theoretical physics","Master the maths properly rather than just survive it","A research internship next summer"],
  worries: ["Losing points to input syntax or a badly written question","Questions that take far too long for what they teach","Grades affecting graduate applications","Burnout"],
  data: ["Fast, detailed anonymous survey feedback on each quiz","Regrade requests that reveal flawed questions and input issues","Expectations of high-achieving students, and of classmates returning to maths: time per question, fairness, adaptive feedback"],
